  ~PF#werefighter/spl/PF#FWWOU.SPL~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/spl/PF#FWWR0.SPL~   ~override~

COPY
  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWAT0.ITM~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWAT1.ITM~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWAT2.ITM~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWAT3.ITM~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWERE.ITM~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWGT1.ITM~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWGT2.ITM~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWGWR.ITM~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWSUH.ITM~   ~override~
  ~PF#werefighter/itm/PF#FWSUR.ITM~   ~override~
